#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/spectral/resonance_discovery_q.ipynb:10002
#: 474a3694476c4817903fce7282b0ee02
msgid "Discover Resonances and Estimate Q Factors"
msgstr "共振モードを発見してQ値を推定する"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/spectral/resonance_discovery_q.ipynb:10004
#: e16ba649655e41ea8cc425feee7bfe86
msgid ""
"Mechanical resonances in suspensions, mirror substrates, and vacuum chambers "
"can introduce steep noise peaks or destabilize feedback control loops. "
"Identifying resonance natural frequencies ($f_n$) and quality factors ($Q$) "
"enables building notch filters, damping loops, and tracking structural "
"health."
msgstr "懸架系、鏡基底、真空チェンバーにおける機械的共振は、急峻なノイズピークをもたらしたりフィードバック制御ループを不安定化させたりします。共振固有周波数（$f_n$）とクオリティファクタ（$Q$）を特定することで、ノッチフィルタの構築、制振ループの設計、および構造健全性の監視が可能になります。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/spectral/resonance_discovery_q.ipynb:10006
#: 196f958bf2d9451ebf2f5b169a4c4299
msgid "**What you will achieve:**"
msgstr "**このチュートリアルで達成できること：**"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/spectral/resonance_discovery_q.ipynb:10007
#: ef56e361ac2b4c40a8a7979ff581d1a2
msgid ""
"Generate an impulse-like excitation and synthetic multi-mode resonant "
"response (3 modes at 73, 211, and 389 Hz)."
msgstr "インパルス状の加振と合成多重モード共振応答（73 Hz、211 Hz、389 Hzの3つのモード）を生成します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/spectral/resonance_discovery_q.ipynb:10008
#: 99943782adf5419a8c3851a55425ed8e
msgid ""
"Detect drive triggers and contrast pre-excitation versus post-excitation "
"amplitude spectral densities (ASDs)."
msgstr "駆動トリガーを検出し、加振前と加振後の振幅スペクトル密度（ASD）を比較対比します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/spectral/resonance_discovery_q.ipynb:10009
#: 8ddf350ec8b643db9a11b1deecd47137
#, fuzzy
msgid "Compute the complex transfer function and discover peak candidates."
msgstr "複素伝達関数とピーク候補の発見"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/spectral/resonance_discovery_q.ipynb:10010
#: 0ca333bd41a64ca58744a676d20a35aa
msgid ""
"Fit a discrete complex frequency-response model $H(z)$ using "
"`gwexpy.fitting.fit_series` to estimate $f_n$ and $Q$."
msgstr ""
"`gwexpy.fitting.fit_series` を用いて離散複素周波数応答モデル $H(z)$ をフィッティングし、$f_n$ と $Q$ "
"を推定します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/spectral/resonance_discovery_q.ipynb:10011
#: 7a1995bbe6384aef83ced80f8ca8a27b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Cross-check frequency-domain fits against time-domain ringdown envelopes ($\t"
"au_A$, $T_{60}$, $Q$)."
msgstr "周波数領域のフィット結果を、時間領域のリングダウン包絡線（$\\tau_A$, $T_{60}$, $Q$）と相互照合します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/spectral/resonance_discovery_q.ipynb:10012
#: af2bd0bc1a6449cfbb0950f9ba16de0d
msgid ""
"Simulate a stepped-sine projection sweep and evaluate settling time "
"requirements."
msgstr "ステップ正弦波加振スイープをシミュレーションし、セトリング時間（整定時間）の要件を評価します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/spectral/resonance_discovery_q.ipynb:10013
#: 2894a49551624975a42adbb189407861
msgid "Demonstrate failure cases on closely spaced modes and low-SNR records."
msgstr "近接したモードや低S/N比の記録における失敗例・限界例を実証します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/spectral/resonance_discovery_q.ipynb:10015
#: c00c3d004f834d5fad07e5835bc62d4c
msgid ""
"**Data type**: Synthetic impulse excitation and multi-mode response (30 s at "
"2048 Hz)."
msgstr "**データ種別**: 合成インパルス加振および多重モード応答（30秒、2048 Hz）。"

